X: 1
T: Feed Me (Git It!)
O: Alan Menken, 1982
N: The plant's demand number from Little Shop of Horrors. Melody (channel 5) of
N: a hamienet.com MIDI (id 7942), key and octave as in the source (G4 to A5,
N: C-centered rock); chords fitted from the accompaniment (Cm7 and C7 rock with
N: F7-G7 answers). The 2/4 and triplet subdivisions of the source are
N: straightened; pitches are the source's. Scope: the "Feed me!" hook and its
N: answer (source bars 36-46), the section the rest of the song keeps circling
N: back to; the chromatic Eb against the Am7 is the source's blues colour.
